Origin
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an evolution of IES2 (IAW Scan 2) by Tomasz Orczyk:
https://github.com/TzOk83/IES2

The original source code is kept unchanged under legacy/IES2. The protocol,
the ECU tables (src/MarelliIawEcuStudio.Core/Definitions) and the translations
(src/MarelliIawEcuStudio.Core/Localization) are derived from it and remain
subject to its BSD 3-Clause license, reproduced in LICENSE-IES2:

    Copyright (c) 2011-2015, Tomasz Orczyk
    All rights reserved.

Under clause 3 of that license, the name of the original author is not used to
endorse or promote this project.

IES2 translations were contributed by the people credited in its change log
(legacy/IES2/readme.txt): Julio Ortiz (Spanish), Renè Bayer (German), Edin
Huseinagić (Bosnian/Croatian/Serbian), Artur Soares (Portuguese) and Gerrelt
(Dutch, and the early IAW-8F support for the Alfa 33).

